Task MUST complete:
In D:\C#解决方案与.cs\LightInDark, I need to wrap EVERY Harmony patch method (Prefix and Postfix) across the entire Light/ project with try-catch that logs the full stack trace via LightLogger.LogWarning.

The files to modify are:
1. Light/Patches/MainMenuPatch.cs - Already has try-catch on Postfix and LateUpdate. Also wrap ShowRightPanel and HideRightPanel.
2. Light/Patches/DisableLobbyEnginePowerPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
3. Light/Patches/HelpKeyPatch.cs - wrap ALL postfix methods (HelpKeyPatch.Postfix, MeetingCloseHelpPatch.Postfix, ExileCloseHelpPatch.Postfix)
4. Light/Patches/IntroPatch.cs - already has try-catch in coroutine, but wrap the Postfix itself
5. Light/Patches/LoadPatch.cs - wrap Prefix and Postfix
6. Light/Patches/LobbyPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
7. Light/Patches/ModStampPatch.cs - already in Dispatcher, but wrap it
8. Light/Patches/NoColInLobbyPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
9. Light/Patches/RoleInterceptPatch.cs - wrap ALL methods
10. Light/Patches/ServerSelectPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
11. Light/Patches/ShowChatPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
12. Light/Patches/DisconnectPopupPatch.cs - wrap Prefix
13. Light/Patches/VersionPatch.cs - wrap Postfix
14. Light/UI/Ability/AbilityButton.cs - wrap all patch methods (HudManagerStartPatch, HudManagerSetHudActivePatch, PlayerControlFixedUpdatePatch)

For each method, the pattern should be:
```csharp
public static void Postfix(...)
{
    try
    {
        // original code
    }
    catch (System.Exception ex)
    {
        LightInDark.Core.LightLogger.LogWarning("[Light] <ClassName>.<MethodName> NRE: " + ex.Message + "\n" + ex.StackTrace);
    }
}
```

For Prefix methods that return bool, the catch should return the original value (true for pass-through, false for block):
```csharp
public static bool Prefix(...)
{
    try
    {
        // original code
        return true; // or false
    }
    catch (System.Exception ex)
    {
        LightInDark.Core.LightLogger.LogWarning("[Light] <ClassName>.<MethodName> NRE: " + ex.Message + "\n" + ex.StackTrace);
        return true; // pass-through on error
    }
}
```

IMPORTANT: 
- Read each file first before editing
- Use the `replace` tool for targeted edits
- Make sure to add `using LightInDark.Core;` if not already present (for LightLogger access)
- Do NOT change any logic, only wrap with try-catch
- For files in LightAPI/ directory, do NOT modify them (they are a separate project)
- The log message format must be: `[Light] ClassName.MethodName NRE: <message>\n<stacktrace>`

Please proceed file by file.

